  abilityId: 850988
  abilityName: Illogical Axiom
  abilityDesc: 19 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    spark damage restores HP for 3 turns, fills own BB gauge to max, 1 extra action
    for self for 1 turn, 15% damage reduction from all element for 3 turns & boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate for 3 turns
